            <ArticleTitle>&quot;Late-late&quot; retrograde collateral filling from occluded donor coronary artery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e42-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case where the chronically occluded right coronary artery fed retrograde the acutely occluded left anterior descending artery. The &quot;late-late&quot; filling of the target vessel served as a good guide for the recanalisation procedure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
